<main class="leaf-page is-static"><div class="play-stage"><div class="play-inner"><div class="leaf-sheet"><div class="leaf-mast"><h1>Private payments on Base</h1><p class="leaf-lede">Send ETH and USDC privately on Base. Shield once, then pay any address, swap or bridge with zero-knowledge proofs: no custody, and the relayer pays gas. Base is Coinbase's Ethereum layer 2, with ETH for gas and USDC as its main stablecoin.</p></div><div class="leaf-stream"><section class="leaf-beat"><h2>What you can do on Base</h2><ul><li><b>Shield</b> ETH and USDC from your wallet into a private balance. This is the only step that shows your address on-chain.</li><li><b>Send privately</b> to any address on Base. The recipient gets a normal transfer from the pool; nothing on-chain points back to your wallet.</li><li><b>Swap privately</b> between ETH and USDC through Uniswap V3, with the output going straight back into your private balance.</li><li><b>Bridge privately</b> to other chains through NEAR Intents, from the <code>base_eth</code>, <code>base_usdc</code> pools.</li></ul></section><section class="leaf-beat"><h2>Pools, fees and minimums</h2><table class="ping-table"><thead><tr><th>Pool</th><th>Min deposit</th><th>Min send, swap or bridge</th><th>Flat fee</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>ETH</td><td>0.001 ETH</td><td>0.001 ETH</td><td>0.00015 ETH</td></tr><tr><td>USDC</td><td>3 USDC</td><td>2 USDC</td><td>1 USDC</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Every private spend pays the flat fee plus 0.35% of the amount, deducted from the amount. Shielding has no Agpool fee. Bridges add the solver's own quote, which the app shows before you confirm.</p></section><section class="leaf-beat"><h2>How it stays private</h2><ul><li>Your device builds a zero-knowledge proof that you own funds in the pool, without saying which deposit they came from.</li><li>A relayer submits the transaction and pays the gas, so your wallet never signs or pays for a private spend.</li><li>The recipient, the amount and the fee are fixed inside the proof, so nobody in between can change them.</li><li>Your keys come from one wallet signature and stay on your device; the server never sees them. See the <a href="/docs#security">security model</a>.</li></ul></section><section class="leaf-beat"><h2>Get started</h2><p><b>In the browser:</b> open <a href="/app">the app</a>, connect a wallet, choose Base in the network menu, sign once and shield. After that, use Send privately, Swap or Private bridge.</p><p><b>From a terminal or an AI agent:</b> the <a href="/docs#cli">Agpool CLI</a> does the same with JSON output:</p><pre class="leaf-code"><code>npm i -g @agpool/cli
agpool deposit 0.01 --chain base
agpool send 0xRECIPIENT 10 --pool usdc --chain base</code></pre><p>Base is the CLI's default chain, so commands without --chain run on Base.</p><p>Private bridges from Base reach Robinhood Chain, Arbitrum, Ethereum, BNB Chain and Solana through NEAR Intents.</p></section><section class="leaf-beat"><h2>Questions</h2><div><h3>Can people see who I paid on Base?</h3><p>They can see that funds went into the Agpool pool and that a payment came out of it, but not which deposit paid which recipient. The deposit is a public transaction; the link between it and your later payments is what the zero-knowledge proof hides.</p></div><div><h3>Do I need ETH for gas to send privately?</h3><p>Only to shield, because that transaction comes from your own wallet. After that the relayer pays the gas for every private send, swap and bridge, and its fee is taken from the amount you move.</p></div><div><h3>Is Agpool custodial?</h3><p>No. Funds sit in the pool contract and only a proof made with your keys can spend them. The relayer can submit a transaction or decline to, but it cannot change the recipient or the amount, because both are fixed inside the proof.</p></div><div><h3>What does a private send on Base cost?</h3><p>The pool's flat fee plus 0.35% of the amount, taken from the amount. Sending 10 USDC costs 1.035 USDC, so the recipient gets 8.965 USDC. Shielding has no Agpool fee, only network gas.</p></div></section><div class="leaf-note"><p>The pool contracts have not had an external audit yet, and each pool's admin is a 2-of-3 multisig that can pause or upgrade it but cannot move funds. Size your balances accordingly.</p></div><section class="leaf-beat"><h2>Other chains</h2><ul><li><a href="/private-payments/robinhood-chain">Private payments on Robinhood Chain</a></li><li><a href="/private-payments/arbitrum">Private payments on Arbitrum</a></li><li><a href="/private-payments/bnb-chain">Private payments on BNB Chain</a></li></ul><p>Guides: <a href="/guides/send-crypto-privately">how to send crypto without exposing your wallet</a> · <a href="/guides/private-payments-for-ai-agents">private payments for AI agents</a>.</p></section></div><footer class="leaf-foot"><span>© 2026 Agpool</span><div class="leaf-foot-links"><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="/terms">Terms</a><a href="/status">Status</a><a href="/docs#security">Security</a><a href="https://x.com/agpool_robin" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">X</a><a href="mailto:hello@agpool.cash">hello@agpool.cash</a></div></footer></div></div></div><nav class="dock-bar"><div class="dock-track"><a class="leaf-brand" href="/"><svg class="logo-mark" viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="26" height="26" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="3" y="3" width="42" height="42" rx="15" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M24 11.5 34 33.5h-6.2l-1.9-4.6h-3.8l-1.9 4.6h-6.2L24 11.5Zm0 8.8-1.5 4.9h3L24 20.3Z" fill="#FBF6E9"/><circle cx="35.5" cy="12.5" r="3.4" fill="#FFC94A"/></svg>Agpool<span class="leaf-brand-sub">Base</span></a><div class="dock-links"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/docs">Docs</a><a href="/agents">Agents</a><a href="/analytics">Analytics</a><a href="/changelog">Changelog</a></div><a class="leaf-btn" href="/app">Launch app</a></div></nav></main>
